{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/314948-so-sardonyx-system-y-n","id":314948,"title":"So \"Sardonyx System - Y/N?\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-17T17:19:52-08:00","id":314948,"title":"So \"Sardonyx System - Y/N?\"","content":"From the Monday Morning meeting (and about the only new for Scion/Trinity other than 'working on it') is that they may be calling it the Sardonyx System.<br /> <br /> I kinda of like it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1246-arthurhansen","name":"ArthurHansen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1246_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T23:49:19-08:00","id":315094,"title":"","content":"Assuming they mean 'sardonic', it is my hope that they don't use the name. It is somewhat insulting in my part of the country.<br /> Not any kind of major insult, but not something you would want to call someone without them getting a little upset.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2273-incendax","name":"Incendax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T23:59:09-08:00","id":315096,"title":"","content":"No, they mean Sardonyx, as in a kind of onyx","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T01:47:49-08:00","id":315196,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty meh on it.<br /> <br /> I mean, whatever they call it, it's not the end of the world and they're not going to name it something that would be a deal breaker for me.<br /> <br /> It's trying too hard to be clever without any substance to hook you with. A sardonyx is just a red hue onyx. If this was the name for a hypothetical custom system for Cavaliers of Mars, I could see it.<br /> <br /> But Scion and Trinity aren't &quot;red.&quot; So there isn't that hook in it for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T02:22:53-08:00","id":315204,"title":"","content":"I can take or leave it, but that opinion could change depending on whether it turns out there's any deeper meaning to the word. Like it's supposed to reference a game mechanic somehow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Christopher Shaffer, freelancer. Game line contributions: W20, Night Horrors, TC: \u00c6on, Scion (details <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2019/07/stuff-ive-worked-on.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>) <br /> <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2020/10/actual-play-index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> <b>Blog post write-ups of my gaming sessions; Currently running Exalted, and also updating old Promethean sessions</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/171-mythicfox","name":"MythicFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar171_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T05:10:26-08:00","id":315277,"title":"","content":"I would rather get the oft-delayed playtest information than a system name. Call me crazy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1011-phgraves","name":"PHGraves","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1011_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T13:53:21-08:00","id":315689,"title":"","content":"I think Talecrafting could be a cool name that plays on the more fantastical side of OPP products that Scion and Trinity fit in, while also continuing the theme of Storytelling/Storyteller. Also would sound different enough that people wouldn't get it confused.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T09:08:31-08:00","id":316335,"title":"","content":"Without some reasoning as to why, the name Sardonyx just seems off like bad milk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T14:20:03-08:00","id":316528,"title":"","content":"It's not bad, but it doesn't say &quot;rule system&quot; to me. It's like if White Wolf had called its system &quot;Pack Alpha.&quot; Is &quot;Onyx Path system&quot; too prosaic? <br /> <br /> I wonder what they plan on calling the GM/ST.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/140-samcwic","name":"samcwic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T14:23:11-08:00","id":316530,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Dude&quot; perhaps? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2608-squee","name":"Squee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2608_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T09:37:16-08:00","id":317446,"title":"","content":"I'm not sold on it; I'm aware sardonyx is an actual type of stone but next to &quot;Storyteller&quot; and &quot;Storytelling&quot; it stands out, and I'm not sold that it does so in a good way. The other systems at least give an implication of the kind of game you're going for. This...um...not so much.<br /> <br /> That said, it's far from a dealbreaker for me. If they stick with it then more power to them and it won't alter my decision to buy this when it comes out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T11:43:27-08:00","id":317598,"title":"","content":"Someone should say something sarcastic...Y'know, something &quot;sardonic.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T12:33:49-08:00","id":317647,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>samcwic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/314948-so-sardonyx-system-y-n?p=316528#post316528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's not bad, but it doesn't say &quot;rule system&quot; to me. It's like if White Wolf had called its system &quot;Pack Alpha.&quot; Is &quot;Onyx Path system&quot; too prosaic?<br /> <br /> I wonder what they plan on calling the GM/ST.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Onyx Path system&quot; would get a little weird, since we're eventually going to have games built on a few different systems.<br /> <br /> Currently, we're planning on calling the GM the GM. Since we're not continuing the &quot;Storyteller&quot; labeling, it seems easier just to use the generic term. I assume lots of people will say ST anyway, and that's fine. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T14:35:44-08:00","id":317705,"title":"","content":"In my old group we always asked &quot;Who is going to be the Storyteller?&quot; even when we were going to play D&amp;D, so... yeah. I think I have never, ever mentioned &quot;The Strorytelling/teller System&quot;, it's always &quot;let's play WoD!&quot; or more specific &quot;let's play Vampire&quot; or whatever.<br /> <br /> I didn't know sardonix was an actual word for a type of stone, I thought it was a play on words between sardonic and onix (path). Sounds nice though, but maybe something that tells you about the particulars of the system would be better.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I mean, does it have some gimmick that could be easily spoted even if used to run another game? You recognize a D20 game when you see it, or a FATE one or a BRP.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T14:59:19-08:00","id":317711,"title":"","content":"Umm...sardonyx is kinda...red I think. So...the onyx path is turning red...ish for Trinity/Scion?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-21T17:53:28-08:00","id":318583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/314948-so-sardonyx-system-y-n?p=317647#post317647\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Currently, we're planning on calling the GM the GM. Since we're not continuing the &quot;Storyteller&quot; labeling, it seems easier just to use the generic term. I assume lots of people will say ST anyway, and that's fine. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>You could ask Dr. Moran to let you use &quot;Hollyhock God.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/140-samcwic","name":"samcwic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T09:58:31-08:00","id":319034,"title":"","content":"I still favor &quot;Storytold,&quot; but decisions like this are above my pay-grade.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T13:48:01-08:00","id":319281,"title":"","content":"I would have gone with &quot;Mythteller&quot;, as it deals with the myths of gods and their modern day counterparts","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/209-that-other-guy","name":"That Other Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T14:48:05-08:00","id":319318,"title":"","content":"Mythteller is kind of nice for a nod to the Storyteller/ing history, but since this system is going to be for Trinity and Scion, I'm not sure the name works as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T17:04:43-08:00","id":319503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/314948-so-sardonyx-system-y-n?p=319318#post319318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mythteller is kind of nice for a nod to the Storyteller/ing history, but since this system is going to be for Trinity and Scion, I'm not sure the name works as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's why I thought it would work so well. Scion is about gods and classical mythology, while Trinity is about the new gods and heroes of the modern age, action heroes and superheroes","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/209-that-other-guy","name":"That Other Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T16:11:28-08:00","id":320236,"title":"","content":"Personally I can't see it meshing well enough to reconcile the Old with the New, unless those in Trinity are scions as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T20:23:18-08:00","id":320324,"title":"","content":"I understand that they can\u2019t call it Storyteller/Storytelling, not just because those names are already in use but for copyright purposes; but I\u2019d still prefer that they use a name that carries the connotation that this is a system for telling stories. <br /> <br /> I\u2019d also prefer that it carry the connotation that it\u2019s geared for larger-than-life stories: \u201cMythic\u201d or \u201cLegendary\u201d have this connotation, and would be good choices if the system was only being used for <b>Scion</b>. Given that it\u2019s also being used for <b>Trinity Continuum</b>, I find myself leaning more toward something along the lines of \u201cEpic\u201d (the noun, not the adjective).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T21:36:21-08:00","id":320362,"title":"","content":"There's also a problem where Mythic and Epic are already taken. Legendary isn't as far as I can find as a system, but there is a RPG publisher called Legendary Games. That's one of the downsides to the number of smaller indie publishers out there looking for names for both companies and systems if they're using their own. A lot of these more general words are taken.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T13:12:23-08:00","id":322097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>That Other Guy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/314948-so-sardonyx-system-y-n?p=319503#post319503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">while Trinity is about the new gods and heroes of the modern age, action heroes and superheroes</div> </div> </div> </div>Um, no it isn't. Certainly not in my Aeon games. Aberrant perhaps, Adventure....not so sure. I think Myth / Super / Fable labels and the like really don't work well for games like Aeon, which this system also powers. Epic works I think, for the reasons Dataweaver mentioned above. As for 'Sardonyx System'...... hrm, I think I'd need to see the actual system to have meaningful input. I'm settling on neutral with it right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":232,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","user":"CHILL","date":". 11-30-2014, 11:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T00:51:30-08:00","id":322489,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">I think if you are making rpg system that is going to be translated to multiple settings and stories, the system name should key in on what unifying element of the system carries over to every setting. For example Numenera, The Strange, and Shotguns &amp; Sorcery all use the Cypher System, with Cyphers being the objects that empower your characters in all three settings.<br /> <br /> Is there some new mechanic that the new editions of Scion and Trinity will share? I guess we really don't know yet.</span><br /> </span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-17T06:03:28-08:00","id":342845,"title":"","content":"Regardless of the name, we look to have positive movement on the rules - First Draft status in the Monday Meeting Notes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1011-phgraves","name":"PHGraves","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1011_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-17T08:51:31-08:00","id":342979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PHGraves</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/314948-so-sardonyx-system-y-n?p=342845#post342845\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Regardless of the name, we look to have positive movement on the rules - First Draft status in the Monday Meeting Notes.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Haha, the name probably is a pretty silly thing to be picking apart at this early point, but It is an important part of a system that may well be traded on for licensed games in the future. Just as long as it isn't called GURPS I will be happy!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-25T15:11:26-08:00","id":350076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>turkeygiant</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/314948-so-sardonyx-system-y-n?p=342979#post342979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Haha, the name probably is a pretty silly thing to be picking apart at this early point, but It is an important part of a system that may well be traded on for licensed games in the future. Just as long as it isn't called GURPS I will be happy!</div> </div> </div> </div>GURPS is an entirely different RPG and only used the World of Darkness game lines with permission from White Wolf. Unless the GURPS people is in talks with Onyx Path on this, rest assured that it won't say that. Personally, I don't care what the system is called. I just want to see if the rule set will be efficient and fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-25T16:41:22-08:00","id":350140,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>turkeygiant</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/314948-so-sardonyx-system-y-n?p=342979#post342979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Just as long as it isn't called GURPS I will be happy!</div> </div> </div> </div>Preach on! I don't think I could play a game that sounds like a noise my body makes after eating too much Taco Bell.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}